The desktop sidebar was "hidden md:flex", so below the md breakpoint it
just vanished with nothing replacing it (AUDIT_REPORT.md — High: "admin not
mobile-usable"). Adds a slim mobile top bar with a hamburger trigger and a
slide-in drawer sharing the exact same nav list (extracted into NavLinks so
desktop and mobile can never drift apart) — closes on backdrop click or on
navigating. Desktop layout/behavior is unchanged.

